    "resume_en": "22% show 3D relief/bevel (mean relief 3.5/10), 63% carry contour/rim glow (mean glow 5.2/10), 78% sit on a dark background and 76% on a gradient/atmospheric one, 15% of outlined marks use a thick (usually white) contour, 24% add particles/sparkles. Mean saturation 7.2/10, mean brightness 3.4/10, mean complexity 3.9/10. Dominant materials: neon 27%, plastic 26%, metal 10%, vinyl 9%. Dominant lettering families: monogram 49%, custom italic wordmark 25%, script 5%. Dominant palette: #FFFFFF, #000000, #FFD700, #1A1A1A, #111827."
